   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eco-Design for Circularity: Building Sustainable Supply Chains in the Battery and Steel Industries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The General Manager of China Resources Recycling Group (CRRG) requested UNIDO&apos;s support on accelerating the development of Ecological Design and Green Supply Chain of Battery and Steel Industries,&#xa0;with particular focus on policy research, standard setting, platform development, and ecosystem building in areas including scrap steel and end-of-life battery recycling. And then our DDG Mr. ZOU replied a letter to CRRG, confirming UNIDO#s interest in moving forward with the proposed project.</narrative>
